                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Never been too much into casual games, but this shouldn't be called as such. Heck it's basically harsher than Dark Souls! If you somehow end up failing round by dying or losing vital item to complete level, you will lose all progress up to that point, at least Souls gives you a chance to get back what is lost.\n\nIssues became present fast after first few levels and in the end had enough around 20+ in which some spinning blades can make the level fail at several points if you timing is even little bit wrong and placing blocks is bit too slow with drag and drop gameplay. Able to be pause game and place blocks would take this title far and maybe turn back time feature. As it's right now it's pretty darn annyoing to play.\n\nAnother one bites the dust.",
